    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36731" root="كد" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْمٌ أَكْدَادٌ</span></b>  <i>A quick,</i> or <i>swift, people:</i> (As, S,
L:) or <i>a people composing distinct bodies,</i> or
<i>parties,</i> or <i>troops;</i> (L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كتد</span>; and K;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكِدَّةٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكَادِيدُ</span>. (K.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَكْتَادٌ</span>.

